OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal for adoptive families
OL,4,Aacross Cambridgeshire
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Every day spent waiting matters" for
OL,7,Fchildren who need a permanent home, a
OL,8,Fcounty's adoption service has said.
OL,10,FThere are 35 children currently waiting
OL,11,Fto be adopted in Cambridgeshire and
OL,12,FPeterborough, with 14 being part of a
OL,13,Fsibling group.
OL,15,FChildren typically waited 17 months to
OL,16,Fbe adopted in the past year and were
OL,17,Faged two-and-a-half on average,
OL,18,Faccording to the service.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
