OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal for adoptive families
OL,4,Aacross Cambridgeshire
OL,5,
OL,6,F"There are still too many children
OL,7,Fwaiting for adoptive families, and
OL,8,Fevery extra day they wait is a day
OL,9,Fwithout the stability they need," said
OL,10,FEdna Murphy, chair of Cambridgeshire
OL,11,FCounty Council's children and young
OL,12,Fpeople's committee.
